# Windsurf Rules

1. Always execute scripts inside `conda activate wechatDHA` environment (use `conda run -n wechatDHA` prefix)
2. Models are stored uniformly at `/data/models/`
3. Keep variables unified and reusable — avoid redundant definitions
4. When facing uncertain choices, always ask the user or search the web before deciding
5. When making large changes, ensure they do not break other pipelines
6. 每完成一项任务，将其更新到 `advisor_out/comparison/pipeline_plan.md` 合适的位置记录起来，包括：完成时间、修改内容摘要、验证结果。这样做是为了方便记忆、避免失忆，确保每次对话都能快速回顾项目进度。
